---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy | yoyopod" description="Privacy notice (Datenschutzerklärung) for yoyopod.com.">
	<Header />
	<main class="section legal">
		<div class="container narrow">
			<h1>Privacy</h1>
			<div class="card placeholder">
				<p>
					<strong>Placeholder: complete before public launch.</strong> The controller name and
					address below must be filled in before this site goes live.
				</p>
			</div>

			<h2>The short version</h2>
			<p>
				This site sets no cookies and runs no analytics, tracking, or ads. The only personal data
				it ever touches is an email address you choose to give us. Everything is processed within
				the EU.
			</p>

			<h2>Waitlist emails</h2>
			<dl>
				<dt>What we store</dt>
				<dd>Your email address and the signup time. Nothing else.</dd>
				<dt>Why</dt>
				<dd>One purpose only: telling you when yoyopod can be ordered.</dd>
				<dt>Legal basis</dt>
				<dd>
					Your consent (Art. 6 (1) a GDPR), given by submitting the form. You can withdraw it any
					time with one email to the address below; withdrawal deletes your address.
				</dd>
				<dt>Who sees it</dt>
				<dd>Only us. The address is never shared, sold, or used for anything else.</dd>
				<dt>How long</dt>
				<dd>
					Until the availability notification is sent, then it is deleted, or earlier any time
					you ask via the contact below.
				</dd>
			</dl>

			<h2>Hosting</h2>
			<p>
				The site runs on a server operated by Hetzner Online GmbH, Industriestr. 25, 91710
				Gunzenhausen, Germany, which processes data on our behalf under a data processing
				agreement (Art. 28 GDPR). The server is located in the EU; no data is transferred to
				third countries.
			</p>

			<h2>Server logs</h2>
			<p>
				The web server keeps standard access logs (IP address, time, requested page) for
				operating and securing the service. Legal basis: our legitimate interest in a secure,
				working website (Art. 6 (1) f GDPR). Logs are deleted after 14 days.
			</p>

			<h2>Your rights</h2>
			<p>
				Under the GDPR you can ask what we store about you (access), have it corrected, deleted,
				or restricted, receive it in a portable format, and object to processing. One email to
				the address below is enough. You also have the right to complain to a data protection
				supervisory authority; for us that is the Landesbeauftragte für den Datenschutz und die
				Informationsfreiheit Baden-Württemberg.
			</p>
			<p>This site makes no automated decisions and builds no profiles.</p>

			<h2>Contact</h2>
			<dl>
				<dt>Controller</dt>
				<dd>[name and address of the site operator]</dd>
				<dt>Contact</dt>
				<dd><a href="mailto:privacy@yoyopod.com">privacy@yoyopod.com</a></dd>
			</dl>
		</div>
	</main>
	<Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.legal h2 {
		font-size: 1.3rem;
		margin-top: 2.25rem;
	}

	.legal p,
	.legal dd {
		color: var(--ink-75);
	}

	.placeholder {
		border: 2px dashed var(--cyan);
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.placeholder p {
		margin-bottom: 0;
		color: var(--ink);
	}

	dl {
		margin: 0;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: max-content 1fr;
		gap: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
	}

	dt {
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--ink);
	}

	dd {
		margin: 0;
	}

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		dl {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 0.15rem;
		}

		dd {
			margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		}
	}
</style>
